    "sections": {
        "description": "WENS Nexus is a modern Full Site Editing (FSE) WordPress child theme of WENS Haelo, designed for SaaS startups, technology companies, software agencies, and IT service providers. It features a clean, professional design with fully customizable block-based templates, responsive layouts, and optimized performance. With pre-designed sections for services, features, pricing, testimonials, blogs, FAQs, and contact pages, WENS Nexus makes it easy to build a fast, engaging, and professional business website without any coding."
